      ],
      "source": "https://www.mtmemory.org/nodes/view/128605",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The local newspaper, the Seeley‑Swan Pathfinder, has been reporting on Potomac’s community and events for decades.",
